sequenceDiagram
    %% Sequence Diagram — Shipment Creation, Dock Access Pass & Gate Check-In/Out

    actor WH as Warehouse Authority
    participant API as FastAPI (/v1/warehouse & /v1/gate)
    participant PassSvc as passes.py / pass_check.py
    participant GateSvc as gate.py
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant TG as Telegram Bot
    actor Driver
    actor Guard as Gate Security

    WH->>API: POST /v1/warehouse/shipments (order_ref, driver, slot)
    API->>DB: Create shipment + appointment + shipment_assignments + truck_visit (EXPECTED)
    API->>PassSvc: issue() -> 128-bit DAP-... (store SHA-256 only, ISSUED)
    API->>TG: deliver() raw pass code to driver (outside DB txn)
    TG-->>Driver: "New shipment ORD... Dock Access Pass: DAP-..."

    Driver->>TG: Replies with "DAP-..."
    TG->>PassSvc: pass_check.check() (max 5 failed guesses -> lock + escalate)
    PassSvc->>DB: Hash match -> set shipment_assignments.confirmed_at
    PassSvc-->>Driver: "Pass confirmed - shipment is now visible in chat."

    Driver->>Guard: Arrives at gate with DAP code, vehicle & licence
    Guard->>API: POST /v1/gate/validate (code, reg, licence)
    API->>GateSvc: validate() (Redis failure limit + 8-step refusal order)
    GateSvc->>DB: Pass ISSUED -> VALIDATED
    GateSvc-->>Guard: Validated (shipment, dock, window)

    Guard->>API: POST /v1/gate/check-in (request_key idempotent)
    API->>GateSvc: check_in() (optimistic row_version)
    GateSvc->>DB: Pass -> ACTIVE, Visit -> CHECKED_IN, Shipment -> AT_GATE, facility_checkins upsert

    WH->>API: POST /v1/warehouse/visits/{id}/unloading-complete
    API->>GateSvc: unloading_complete()
    GateSvc->>DB: Pass -> COMPLETED, Visit -> OPERATIONS_COMPLETE, Appointment -> COMPLETED

    Guard->>API: POST /v1/gate/check-out (request_key idempotent)
    API->>GateSvc: check_out()
    GateSvc->>DB: Pass -> CLOSED, Visit -> CHECKED_OUT, Shipment -> COMPLETED, gate_out_ts set
